## 🧠 Problem-Solving Process

For every LeetCode problem:

1. Understand the problem
2. Identify the pattern
3. Think about brute force
4. Analyze time & space complexity
5. Find the optimized approach
6. Write the solution
7. Test edge cases
8. Review the solution
9. Re-solve without looking
10. Add the pattern to your notes

