## 🔍 Pattern Recognition Cheat Sheet

| If you see... | Think... |
|---|---|
| Pair in sorted array | Two Pointers |
| Longest/shortest substring | Sliding Window |
| Frequency/counting | HashMap |
| Duplicate detection | HashSet |
| Matching parentheses | Stack |
| Next greater/smaller | Monotonic Stack |
| Sorted search | Binary Search |
| Linked list cycle | Fast & Slow Pointers |
| Tree traversal | DFS / BFS |
| Top K | Heap |
| All combinations | Backtracking |
| Connected components | DFS / BFS / Union Find |
| Shortest path | BFS / Dijkstra |
| Repeated subproblems | Dynamic Programming |
| Local optimal choice | Greedy |

